<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R78229> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apart from an anomalous concentration measured in Afikpo Shale (Middle Segment), the results obtained revealed that rock samples from all the sampling locations yielded cadmium concentrations of < 0.10 mg kg\u20131 and the measured concentrations were below the average crustal abundance of 0.50 mg kg\u20131. Although background concentration of <1.00 \u00B1 0.02 mg kg\u20131 was measured in Abakaliki Shale, rock samples from all the sampling locations revealed anomalous lead concentrations above average crustal abundance of 30 mg kg\u20131. "^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
