<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789570> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "This collection of studies explores the diverse applications of Landsat-8 imagery in agriculture and environmental monitoring, including crop condition assessment, soil texture estimation, and chlorophyll concentration analysis. For researchers, remote sensing professionals, scientists, and students, these papers provide valuable methodologies and practical examples of how to use Landsat-8 data to improve land management, enhance monitoring accuracy, and support decision-making in agriculture and environmental conservation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
