<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789600> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "This collection of studies showcases the use of Landsat-8 imagery in diverse environmental and agricultural applications, from coral reef classification and monitoring to mapping rice planted areas and detecting crop diseases. These works highlight improved methodologies, such as soft supervised classification and vegetation gradient analysis, offering valuable tools for scientists, remote sensing professionals, and students. The research demonstrates how Landsat-8 can be effectively used for ecological monitoring, land use management, and crop health analysis, providing critical insights for future studies and practical applications."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
