<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789629> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Upgraded classification of hyperspectral images involves improving the accuracy and efficiency of identifying and classifying land cover types or materials based on their spectral signatures across numerous narrow, contiguous bands. The advancements typically include incorporating more sophisticated machine learning algorithms (e.g., deep learning, support vector machines, random forests), utilizing spectral unmixing methods, and applying spatial and contextual information."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789629> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
