<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789679> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "FIM is a fusion technique that combines the spatial information from a high-resolution panchromatic image with the spectral detail of a lower-resolution multispectral or hyperspectral image. It uses a smoothing filter to modulate the intensity of the panchromatic image, which helps preserve both the spatial and spectral quality of the fused image."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
