<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789791> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Chlorophyll content estimation using Hyperspectral Imaging (HSI) and Multispectral Imaging (MSI) involves using the spectral data captured by these imaging systems to assess the concentration of chlorophyll in plants. Both HSI and MSI can detect the specific reflectance properties of vegetation across different wavelengths, especially in the visible and near-infrared regions, where chlorophyll absorption and reflection features are prominent."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789791> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
