<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789837> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The SERNAGEOMIN SIGEX database is a comprehensive geological and mining data repository managed by SERNAGEOMIN (National Geology and Mining Service of Chile). SIGEX (Sistema de Informaci\u00F3n Geol\u00F3gica y Exploraci\u00F3n) provides access to a wide range of geospatial data, including geological maps, mineral exploration data, and mining resources across Chile. The database supports the mining industry, researchers, and decision-makers by offering valuable information for mineral exploration, environmental monitoring, and resource management."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
