<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R789903> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Data quality for PRISMA (PRecursore IperSpettrale della Missione Applicativa) refers to the accuracy and reliability of the hyperspectral data collected by the PRISMA satellite, launched by the Italian Space Agency. PRISMA provides high-resolution spectral data across a wide range of wavelengths, which is crucial for applications such as environmental monitoring, agriculture, and land use mapping."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
