<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R78> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Aquaculture and Fisheries"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790000> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "HYPSTAR is a tool or framework used for the analysis and processing of hyperspectral data, primarily focused on enhancing the interpretation of spectral information from various sources like satellites, drones, or airborne sensors. It is designed to facilitate the extraction of meaningful patterns, features, and classifications from hyperspectral images, which contain a large number of spectral bands."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
