<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790007> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "This collection focuses on the diverse applications of PRISMA hyperspectral data for environmental monitoring, spanning from snow grain size mapping over glaciers to the analysis of volcanic carbon dioxide emissions. The studies explore the development of algorithms for cryosphere analysis, monitoring aquatic ecosystems, and generating synthetic PRISMA images using machine learning. These advancements showcase PRISMA's potential for enhancing environmental research and ecosystem management, offering valuable insights and methodologies for researchers, remote sensing professionals, and students working in climate science and ecosystem monitoring."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
