<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790049> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P41661> "RFR outperforms other models significantly"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790049> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/P41661> "RFR, KNN outperform SVR, LR"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790049> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Contribution> .
