<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790067> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Qwen 1 small language model, developed in December 2023, is a multilingual pre-trained model available in various sizes (1.8B, 7B, 14B, 72B), utilizing multi-head attention, rotary position embeddings, SwiGLU activation, and RMS normalization."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790067> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/C15002> .
