<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790074> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "his collection explores the diverse applications of Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 data for environmental and agricultural monitoring. Topics include water quality assessment, vegetation cover estimation, bushfire severity mapping, and crop monitoring. Using advanced processing techniques and machine learning, these studies showcase how Sentinel data enhances land management and ecosystem monitoring. This collection offers valuable insights for researchers, remote sensing professionals, and students in environmental science, agriculture, and disaster management."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
