<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790136> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Urban area mapping using Sentinel-2 involves utilizing the high-resolution optical imagery from the satellite to identify and delineate urban areas. Sentinel-2 provides multispectral data with 13 bands, including visible, near-infrared (NIR), and short-wave infrared (SWIR), which are highly effective for urban land cover classification. The process typically starts with preprocessing, including atmospheric correction and cloud masking, to ensure clean and accurate data."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790136> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
