<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790156> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "This collection highlights the versatile applications of Sentinel-2 satellite data in environmental and agricultural monitoring. The studies explore topics such as high-resolution urban development mapping in Delhi NCR, land cover analysis using both supervised and unsupervised learning, and crop monitoring with vegetation indices. Additionally, the research investigates the use of time series NDVI data for monitoring crop phenology and integrating Sentinel-2 with aerial images for enhanced analysis. These studies provide valuable methodologies for researchers, remote sensing professionals, and students working in urban planning, agriculture, and environmental monitoring."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
