<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R790187> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "This collection focuses on the integration of Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 satellite data for agricultural and environmental monitoring. The studies cover a range of applications, including crop classification and rice extraction, detection of small-scale forest fires, and mapping of early and late sowing for soybean and cotton crops using deep learning. The research highlights the benefits of fusing Sentinel-1's radar and Sentinel-2's multispectral data for improved land use classification and monitoring. These methodologies provide valuable insights for researchers, remote sensing professionals, and students in precision agriculture, environmental management, and disaster monitoring."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
