<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796004> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Gemma 2 small language model, released in July 2024, is a pre-trained model available in 2B, 9B, and 27B parameter sizes, featuring multi-head attention, rotary position embeddings, GELUtanh activation, and alternating local and global attention with RMS normalization."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
