<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796005> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "These models are designed for general-purpose use across a wide range of tasks and domains. \u200B They are not specialized for any particular field but are versatile and capable of handling various types of text and instructions. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
