<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796007> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Logit Soft-Capping training technique involves limiting the range of the logits (raw model outputs before applying the softmax function) to prevent extreme values, thereby stabilizing training and improving model performance."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
