<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796047> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The CodeTextBook training dataset is used to train models in the Phi series. \u200B It includes high-quality, reasoning-dense data primarily focused on coding tasks. \u200BThe dataset size is 7B tokens."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
