<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796048> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Phi-1 small language model, released in June 2023, is a 1.3 billion parameter model pre-trained on the CodeTextBook dataset, featuring Multi-Head Attention (MHA), GELUtanh activation, RoPE positional encoding, and FlashAttention for efficient performance in coding tasks."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
