<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796059> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Abstract"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796060> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Phi-2 small language model, released in December 2023, is a 2.7 billion parameter model pre-trained on the CodeTextBook and synthetic datasets, featuring Multi-Head Attention (MHA), GELUtanh activation, RoPE positional encoding, FlashAttention, and Deep ZeRO Stage 2 for improved efficiency and performance."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
