<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796074> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/hasContent> "Papers utilize the Hurwicz criterion in decision-making to address uncertainty and provide a balanced approach between optimism and pessimism in the decision process."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
