<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796079> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/hasContent> "[Zero-sum game](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zero-sum_game) is a mathematical representation in game theory and economic theory of a situation that involves two competing entities, where the result is an advantage for one side and an equivalent loss for the other.\nThe educational video on zero-sum game solutions as a part of the [Open Education Resources with Ukraine Project](https://av.tib.eu/publisher/Projekt__Open_Education_Resources_with_Ukraine_) is at the TIB AV-portal ![https://av.tib.eu/media/68343]."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
