<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796091> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The RefinedWeb training dataset includes 5 trillion tokens of high-quality, extensively filtered web data. \u200B It is designed to provide a valuable resource for training web-aware models, ensuring that the data is of high quality and suitable for developing robust language models. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
