<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796092> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Dolma-1.6 training dataset is an open corpus consisting of three trillion tokens. \u200B It is designed for language model pretraining research and includes a diverse range of high-quality text data. \u200B The dataset is part of the Dolma project, which aims to provide a comprehensive and extensive collection of text for training language models. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
