<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796097> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The MobiLlama small language model, released in February 2024, is available in 0.5 billion and 0.8 billion parameter versions, pre-trained on the LLM360 Amber dataset, and features Grouped Query Attention (GQA), SwiGLU activation, and parameter-sharing techniques to optimize performance and efficiency for mobile devices."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
