<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796098> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The LLM360 Amber training dataset consists of a diverse collection of sources, including Arxiv, Book, C4, Refined-Web, StarCoder, StackExchange, and Wikipedia. \u200B The dataset is designed to provide a comprehensive and high-quality foundation for training language models, capturing a wide range of text from various domains. The dataset comprised 1.26T tokens divided into 360 data chunks."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
