<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796204> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The CC100-XL training dataset is a large-scale multilingual dataset derived from the Common Crawl web corpus. It is designed to capture a wide snapshot of the internet, providing a diverse collection of text from various languages and domains. \u200B The dataset includes a substantial amount of text data, making it suitable for training LLMs/SLMs that require extensive and varied linguistic input. \u200B \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
