<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796214> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Pruning is a technique used to reduce a model's size and computational requirements by identifying and removing less important or redundant parameters and components, thereby making the model more efficient without significantly sacrificing its performance. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
