<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796221> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Orca 2 training dataset is designed to enhance the reasoning capabilities of SLMs by providing them with high-quality, detailed instructional data. \u200B The dataset includes approximately 817k instances. The Orca 2 dataset is particularly focused on improving the model's ability to handle complex reasoning tasks, making it a valuable resource for training SLMs to perform at levels comparable to much larger models. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796221> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
