<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796222> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Orca 2 SLM includes 7B parameters, released in November 2023, generated via distillation, trained on the Orca 2 dataset, based upon the LLaMA-2-7B SLM and making use of prompt erasing technique"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
