<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796224> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The FLAN-v2 training dataset is a comprehensive collection designed to enhance the instruction-following capabilities of LLMs/SLMs.  It includes a diverse set of tasks and data sources to ensure broad coverage and robust performance across various domains. \u200B The dataset includes 5M questions, which are initially processed through ChatGPT, and 1M of these responses are further refined by GPT-4 to create the training set. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796224> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
