<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796225> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Orca small language model, released in June 2023, trained on the FLAN-v2 dataset, using complex explanation traces from GPT-4, employing techniques like explanation tuning and progressive learning. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796225> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/C15002> .
