<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796226> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The \"Teachers are ChatGPT, GPT-4\" training technique involves using outputs from advanced models like ChatGPT and GPT-4 to guide and improve the training of smaller models through methods such as instruction tuning and explanation tuning. \u200B\u200B\u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796226> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
