<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796227> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Progressive Learning training technique involves starting with simpler examples and gradually moving to more complex ones, using intermediate-level teachers to improve the distillation effects and enhance the learning process of smaller models. \u200B\u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
