<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796246> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Databricks-dolly-15k training dataset is designed to enhance the instruction-following capabilities of LLMs/SLMs. The dataset consists of 15k instruction-following examples. The dataset includes a variety of tasks and scenarios to train models to follow instructions effectively. These tasks cover a wide range of domains and types of instructions, ensuring that the trained models can handle diverse and complex queries. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796246> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796246> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Databricks-dolly-15k"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796247> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "Instruction tuning involves fine-tuning a pre-trained language model using specific instructions or tasks to enhance its ability to follow directions and perform particular applications more effectively. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796247> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/C15002> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796247> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://orkg.org/orkg/class/Resource> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796247> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Instruction tuning"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R796248> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The Dolly-v2 small language model, released in April 2023, is an instruction-tuned model with 3 billion, 7 billion, and 12 billion parameters, trained on the Databricks-dolly-15k dataset. \u200B"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
