<http://orkg.org/orkg/resource/R8357> <http://orkg.org/orkg/predicate/description> "The paper addresses the challenge that as scholarly communication increases, specific core scientific statements are difficult to find, connect, and curate. The redundancy of these statements across multiple sources makes it difficult to determine attribution, quality, and provenance. The goal is to create a model for \"nanopublications\" - core scientific statements with associated context that can be cited, attributed, and reviewed."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
